om/repos/celery/celery/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/deployments","created_at":"2009-04-24T11:31:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T11:08:53Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-10T15:04:28Z","git_url":"git://github.com/celery/celery.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:celery/celery.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery","homepage":"https://docs.celeryq.dev","size":36397,"stargazers_count":28268,"watchers_count":28268,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":4989,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":772,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["amqp","python","python-library","python3","queue-tasks","queue-workers","queued-jobs","redis","redis-queue","sqs","sqs-queue","task-manager","task-runner","task-scheduler"],"visibility":"public","forks":4989,"open_issues":772,"watchers":28268,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/pulls/4432","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/4432","diff_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/4432.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/4432.patch","merged_at":"2017-12-11T12:08:32Z"},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\n#4274 is caused by the fact that when the result backend does not support native join, `ResultSet.get` calls `ResultSet.join`, which itself calls `ResultSet.get`. When that second `.get` call is made, `on_interval` is passed in. \r\n\r\nCurrently, `ResultSet.get` does not take such an argument, so the call results in the `TypeError` described in the issue. However, since `ResultSet.join` _does_ take such an option (as does `.join_native`), it's safe to pass along down to the join methods and should be accepted by `.get`. \r\n\r\nThis PR changes `ResultSet.get` to accept and pass along the `on_interval` argument to `ResultSet.join` (or `ResultSet.join_native`), which resolves the issue.\r\n\r\nThe PR also adds a unit test that prevents regression of this behavior. The unit test was verified to fail on `master` (at https://github.com/celery/celery/commit/28c2c09d380c62f9e17776811735a5c8c4ed8320), but passes on the current branch head. The unit test only tests the behavior when native join is not supported by the backend, as backends that support native join did not trigger this error. The unit test can be easily changed to cover both scenarios, just in case, if deemed necessary.\r\n\r\nFinally, the PR adds an integration test that tests the scenario laid out in the unit test. As the integration test is run on the DynamoDB backend, which does not support native join, it should also prevent further regression of this behavior.\r\n\r\nFixes #4274 \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/4432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/4432/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/